# Death Baron's rulings (2018-07-13): "Skeletons you control" includes the Baron itself once it is a Skeleton, and a creature that is both a
# Skeleton and a Zombie gets the bonus only once (CR 613.1f, 205.3m). On turn 3 Bot1's Arcane Adaptation, choosing Skeleton, makes every creature
# Bot1 controls a Skeleton too: Death Baron (a Zombie Wizard Skeleton) becomes a 3/3 with deathtouch, and Walking Corpse (a Zombie Skeleton)
# stays a 3/3, not a 4/4. Bot2's Walking Corpse is not Bot1's and stays a plain 2/2.

